Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish If you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That lion dog's a giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we ask around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't matter even if we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't answer us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The people here are all under\Nthe Shogun Orochi's influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lots of normal-looking people\Nhere who don't seem like bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Some towns people have\Nbeen here a very long time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,until 20 years ago this\Nwas a vibrant castle town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And many of the businesses\Nhave stayed since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but as for the houses, Orochi's\Nsubordinates seized all the ones they liked;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,only the merchants who they\Ndeemed essential could stay;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the others were thrown from their\Nhomes—they can never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is such a cruel place!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A sumo wrestler? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, must be something crazy\Ngoing on in the town square.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since a sumo\Nwrestler came flying out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna guess it's a sumo match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yokozuna, the flower capital,\Nstands victorious! Here he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who remains to challenge Ulashima?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone dare?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Still nothing but weaklings, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Unashima is\Nstill hungry for new opponents,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he has defeated 19 men already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the number of bones that have been\Nbroken, let's check in with the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 10 arm bones, 15 leg bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,looking like 52 ribs, four\Nskulls, and let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven backbones—I think that's 88 bones\Nin total and four wrestlers who flew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:05:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He shows no mercy;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,his strength surpasses man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What you see before\Nyou is an undefeatable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,undefeatable
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's hear a round\Nof applause for Unashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A quick note, this is a\Nspecial match to the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who gets best\NUnashima wins 500 gold coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back down now, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll bet on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That prize is gonna be ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We know just what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Put those scandals in their place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Crack their skulls!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku, you accepted my\Ninvitation after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you finally came\Naround and decided to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You are way too big to hide behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is certainly a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a woman here who is\Napparently engaged to Unashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Loved by a Yokozuna, I'm a little\Njealous, and she came here to support him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.33,0:06:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big day for our champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a special someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be his wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He just got that idea in his big head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The man can be quite forward, as you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kiku, I'll have a wrestling\Nmatch in Bekori Town today, Pei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll come so I can\Nshow you just how strong I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, I will\Nnot budge on the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for someone! Can you help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where the\Nboss of this town is at?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She should be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.89,0:07:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good at her suspender!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks kind of big, but I guess\Nthat's just right for Urashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all ignoring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and do me a favor, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab Okiku, bring her over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats boss, it seems\Nyou're quite the charmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Next you're gonna have to\Ntrain us in the arts of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, we might tell ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey lady, Urashima told\Nus to get you, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got stuff to do, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your deal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty good charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But a nice slap is still my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady, why are you resisting? Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to cut an unarmed man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even have any clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Throw, why didn't you stop that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:09:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't cut down\Na man in his underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just didn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have a feeling she's\Nnot half as helpless as she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too low class to even be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she get through the\Ngate in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew she was a trip\Nthe second I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you peasants know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a member of the\Nwarrior class, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You commoners are nothing but\Nfilth beneath my feet, Perk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lives are meaningless\Nto someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I may spare you, or I may slay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku, having heard that,\Nignore those vermin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and be mine! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take no for an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.37,0:11:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What I see are people just\Ntrying to survive, not vermin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ye vulgar beast, the only filth\Nbefore me is thine own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She cut off this top knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Commodore woman rejected him hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,His top knot has been violated!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss should be coming\Nfor us any time now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And brought me shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I do that in public?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's become a demon of fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that pose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the far-bang slap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It sends you straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we talk this through?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you are the kind of\Nbeast who would strike a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I shall strike you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How in blazes did you counter my attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that matter,\Nhow do you know Okikupe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to tear Okiku\Napart with my bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Or my reputation will be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.67,0:15:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.61,0:16:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,see
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,get through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never lost a sumo match!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I said move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But he said for slap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dodging every one of those attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't win if you don't fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ear splitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eye splitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure that's not legal, you cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A Yokozuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.07,0:17:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold him, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yokozuna got his topknot\Nchopped off by some lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He might start a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to take revenge, and\Nnow he's fighting some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you want me to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.47,0:18:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for sumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy tearing this\Nlittle girl's cheek off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have your booboon back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.19,0:18:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't pinch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're getting pinched, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have gone around\Nmentioning the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.61,0:18:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan is gonna come\Nback, and then you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a dumb brat like you knows that uttering\Nthe name Kozuki is a serious offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have agreed to work\Nwith us while you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.23,0:18:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop chasing after ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.33,0:19:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been a\NKozuki here in 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We shut them down after they\Ntried to destroy the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nothing but evil spirits now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Scram, you pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And Okiku, you dug your own\Ngrave, you little ingrate, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.43,0:19:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to turn down a request\Nfrom a member of the warrior class,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you peasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.17,0:19:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You shamed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My honor demands that\NI smash your head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's no problem, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.05,0:20:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and smash me\Nif you think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be easy for\Na champ like you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.35,0:20:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the greatest Yokozuna in all Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All banks slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A rope, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,True, you may be a Yokozuna, but me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the man who's going to\Nbe the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.21,0:22:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.87,0:22:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,GIANT!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.21,0:22:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Toss Conney!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.93,0:23:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.67,0:23:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.71,0:23:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Saul, am I safe now, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.65,0:24:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yokozuna is out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.61,0:24:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know where he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.51,0:24:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He really lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.99,0:24:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,After all those fights he\Nlost to that odd little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.13,0:24:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm a Yokozuna too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.49,0:24:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If anybody else wants to\Nfight, then bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.65,0:24:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.29,0:24:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is bound to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.95,0:24:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't better!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.07,0:24:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.25,0:24:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed the magistrate, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.91,0:25:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.23,0:25:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's allies with that sumo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.65,0:25:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.99,0:25:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to fight the boss of this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.31,0:25:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them we're here to save Tama!
